<title>POLAND: POLISH C.BANK REJECTS ALL BIDS AT REVERSE REPO.</title>
<headline>POLISH C.BANK REJECTS ALL BIDS AT REVERSE REPO.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland rejected all 16 million zlotys of bids at Friday's 100 million zloty reverse NBP-bill repurchase auction, the bank said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
</text>
